*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "HPLJ1018.PPD"
*Product: "(HP LaserJet 1018)"
*Manufacturer: "HP"
*ModelName: "HP LaserJet 1018"
*ShortNickName: "HP LaserJet 1018 rastertozjs"
*NickName: "HP LaserJet 1018 rastertozjs"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Hewlett-Packard;MDL:HP LaserJet 1018;CMD:ACL;CLS:PRINTER;DES:HP LaserJet 1018;"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "12"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.3
*cupsModelNumber: 1018
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsLanguages: "es"
*cupsFilter2: "application/vnd.cups-raster application/vnd.hp-zjs 0 /Library/Printers/HP1018/Filter/rastertozjs"

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: Gray
*ColorModel Gray/Grayscale: "<</cupsColorOrder 0/cupsColorSpace 3/cupsBitsPerColor 8>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 600dpi/600 dpi: "<</HWResolution[600 600]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 1200x600dpi/1200x600 dpi: "<</HWResolution[1200 600]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Letter
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Executive/Executive: "<</PageSize[522 756]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A6/A6: "<</PageSize[297 420]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize ISOB5/B5 (ISO): "<</PageSize[498 708]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Postcard/Postcard: "<</PageSize[283 416]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Env10/Envelope #10: "<</PageSize[297 684]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvDL/Envelope DL: "<</PageSize[311 623]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvC5/Envelope C5: "<</PageSize[459 649]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvMonarch/Envelope Monarch: "<</PageSize[279 540]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w558h774/16K 197x273 mm: "<</PageSize[558 774]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Letter
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Executive/Executive: "<</PageSize[522 756]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A6/A6: "<</PageSize[297 420]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion ISOB5/B5 (ISO): "<</PageSize[498 708]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Postcard/Postcard: "<</PageSize[283 416]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Env10/Envelope #10: "<</PageSize[297 684]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion EnvDL/Envelope DL: "<</PageSize[311 623]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion EnvC5/Envelope C5: "<</PageSize[459 649]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion EnvMonarch/Envelope Monarch: "<</PageSize[279 540]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w558h774/16K 197x273 mm: "<</PageSize[558 774]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*% 96 pixels at 600 dpi (11.52 pt) are clipped on every side
*DefaultImageableArea: Letter
*ImageableArea Letter: "11.52 11.52 600.48 780.48"
*ImageableArea Legal: "11.52 11.52 600.48 996.48"
*ImageableArea Executive: "11.52 11.52 510.48 744.48"
*ImageableArea A4: "11.52 11.52 583.48 830.48"
*ImageableArea A5: "11.52 11.52 408.48 583.48"
*ImageableArea A6: "11.52 11.52 285.48 408.48"
*ImageableArea ISOB5: "11.52 11.52 486.48 696.48"
*ImageableArea Postcard: "11.52 11.52 271.48 404.48"
*ImageableArea Env10: "11.52 11.52 285.48 672.48"
*ImageableArea EnvDL: "11.52 11.52 299.48 611.48"
*ImageableArea EnvC5: "11.52 11.52 447.48 637.48"
*ImageableArea EnvMonarch: "11.52 11.52 267.48 528.48"
*ImageableArea w558h774: "11.52 11.52 546.48 762.48"

*DefaultPaperDimension: Letter
*PaperDimension Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension Legal: "612 1008"
*PaperDimension Executive: "522 756"
*PaperDimension A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension A5: "420 595"
*PaperDimension A6: "297 420"
*PaperDimension ISOB5: "498 708"
*PaperDimension Postcard: "283 416"
*PaperDimension Env10: "297 684"
*PaperDimension EnvDL: "311 623"
*PaperDimension EnvC5: "459 649"
*PaperDimension EnvMonarch: "279 540"
*PaperDimension w558h774: "558 774"

*OpenUI *HPDensity/Print Density: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *HPDensity
*DefaultHPDensity: 3
*HPDensity 1/1 - Extra Light: "<</cupsInteger1 1>>setpagedevice"
*HPDensity 2/2 - Light: "<</cupsInteger1 2>>setpagedevice"
*HPDensity 3/3 - Medium: "<</cupsInteger1 3>>setpagedevice"
*HPDensity 4/4 - Dark: "<</cupsInteger1 4>>setpagedevice"
*HPDensity 5/5 - Extra Dark: "<</cupsInteger1 5>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *HPDensity

*OpenUI *HPEconoMode/EconoMode (Toner Saving): PickOne
*OrderDependency: 41 AnySetup *HPEconoMode
*DefaultHPEconoMode: Off
*HPEconoMode Off/Off: "<</cupsInteger2 0>>setpagedevice"
*HPEconoMode On/On: "<</cupsInteger2 1>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *HPEconoMode

*OpenUI *HPFirmware/Firmware Upload: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 42 AnySetup *HPFirmware
*DefaultHPFirmware: Auto
*HPFirmware Auto/Automatic (when needed): "<</cupsInteger3 0>>setpagedevice"
*HPFirmware Always/Before every job: "<</cupsInteger3 1>>setpagedevice"
*HPFirmware Never/Never: "<</cupsInteger3 2>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *HPFirmware

